{
  "info": {
    "name": "ADC — Petpooja Endpoint Responses",
    "description": "The five endpoints Petpooja calls on A Dough Cookie, plus a security check.\n\n**restID:** `bw8dz5o93u`  ·  **Base URL:** https://adc-backend-copy-production.up.railway.app/api/petpooja\n\nEvery request carries the same **Client Authorization** value configured in the Petpooja dashboard. Requests without it are refused with 401, and requests naming a different restID with 403.\n\nRun 1 through 6 in order and screenshot each response pane.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Menu Sharing  /pushmenu",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "{{client_authorization}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"restaurants\": [\n    {\n      \"restaurantid\": \"5312\",\n      \"active\": \"1\",\n      \"details\": {\n        \"menusharingcode\": \"bw8dz5o93u\",\n        \"restaurantname\": \"A Dough Cookie - Begur\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"categories\": [\n    {\n      \"categoryid\": \"88879\",\n      \"categoryname\": \"Accompaniments\",\n      \"active\": \"1\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"itemid\": \"9658\",\n      \"itemname\": \"Plain Dahi\",\n      \"price\": \"80\",\n      \"item_categoryid\": \"88879\",\n      \"item_tax\": \"11213,20375\",\n      \"in_stock\": \"2\",\n      \"active\": \"1\",\n      \"variation\": [],\n      \"addon\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"addongroups\": [],\n  \"taxes\": [\n    {\n      \"taxid\": \"11213\",\n      \"taxname\": \"CGST\",\n      \"tax\": \"2.5\",\n      \"active\": \"1\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"discounts\": []\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/pushmenu",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "pushmenu"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Menu Sharing Endpoint. Petpooja pushes the full catalogue here.\n\n**Expected response**\n```json\n{\"success\":\"1\",\"message\":\"Menu saved (1 items, 0 addons)\"}\n```"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "console.log(JSON.stringify(pm.response.json(), null, 2));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Order Callback  /callback",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "{{client_authorization}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"restID\": \"bw8dz5o93u\",\n  \"orderID\": \"TC1-1785566115277\",\n  \"status\": \"1\",\n  \"cancel_reason\": \"\",\n  \"minimum_prep_time\": 20\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/callback",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "callback"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Order Callback. Petpooja notifies us when the merchant accepts, rejects or progresses an order.\n\nstatus: -1 Cancelled | 1/2/3 Accepted | 4 Dispatched | 5 Food Ready | 10 Delivered\n\n**Expected response**\n```json\n{\"success\":\"1\",\"message\":\"received\"}\n```\n\nAn unknown order id answers HTTP 200 with success \"0\" — a retry cannot fix a bad id."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "console.log(JSON.stringify(pm.response.json(), null, 2));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
